A line after a comment block in a line block reads the stanza without it

```
- a
  - ::: |
    %%%
b
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="line-block">

        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>b</p>
```

```
- a
  - ::: |
    %%%
    x
    %%%
b
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="line-block">

        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>b</p>
```

```
- ::: |
  x
  %%%
b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="line-block">
      <p>x<br>
b</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
> ::: |
> x
> %%%
b
.
<blockquote>
  <div class="line-block">
    <p>x<br>
b</p>
  </div>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > ::: |
> > %%%
y
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <div class="line-block">

    </div>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>y</p>
```

```
:: t
: ::: |
  x
  %%%
b
  :::
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <div class="line-block">
      <p>x<br>
b</p>
    </div>
  </dd>
</dl>
```
